  m_Name: Pilote -Mail Refomation Program
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Reformation Programme
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: 'Dear Employee,

    The Board has decided to send some of the less reliable
    employees on the Reformation Programme today. Here are the criteria you should
    look for:


    - anyone who took a break of more than 45 minutes;

    - anyone
    who took more than one hour''s worth of breaks in total.

    - anyone who arrived
    after 9 am or before 8:15 am (expected for anyone working in overseeing, they
    should be here at 8 am);

    - anyone with a majority of E''s on their H.E.A.L.T.H
    score;

    - anyone who did not complete their report correctly should also
    be put in reform.


    P.S. I wrote it in your notes so that you would remember. '
